# FS08 part 2 write regression, TeraDesk (#Z C:\Apps\TERADESK\DESKTOP.NAP;
# prep-card.sh tera). Double-click drive C (195,38) opens the C:\ window
# (fx-teraexp: ACC/APPS/AUTO/COREMARK in row 1, ZVIEW (347,250) in row 2,
# DUMPVDI.NAP (430,300) in row 3). Drag DUMPVDI.NAP (156048 B) onto ZVIEW =
# file copy; drag COREMARK onto APPS = folder copy; each confirmed with Return.
# Ticks hz_200 after the injector arms (first EL0 program = the first
# accessory); TeraDesk gets 3600 ticks. IKBD Return 1C / 9C.
100 parkbr
3600 mark T00_UP
3700 move 195 38
3800 down
3803 up
3808 down
3811 up
5000 mark T01_C_OPEN
5200 move 430 298
5400 down
5500 drag 400 280
5600 drag 347 250
5800 up
6800 mark T02_COPY_CONFIRM
7000 key 1C
7006 key 9C
