8800 move 590 205
9000 down
9100 drag 520 205
9200 drag 430 205
9400 up
10400 mark T04_FOLDERCOPY_CONFIRM
10600 key 1C
10606 key 9C
12600 mark T05_FOLDER_COPIED
12800 parkbr
13200 mark END
